    category: "Windows",
    title: "Microsoft 將 WinUI 3 重建 Windows 11 舊版 Print Management 工具，提升系統現代化程度",
    summary: "Microsoft 正逐步將 Windows 11 系統中的傳統元件進行現代化重構。其中，長久以來以 MMC 介面呈現的 Print Management（印表機管理）工具，現已出現在 Release Preview 通道，顯示其即將大規模發布。新版 Print Management 採用 WinUI 3 架構，外觀更符合 Windows 11 的現代設計，取代了過去看似來自舊版 Windows 的介面。儘管外觀改變，新工具仍保留了管理印表機、印表機佇列、驅動程式、印表機埠和共享印表機等所有核心管理功能。這項更新預計會透過 KB5120998 累積更新，從 Release Preview 進入支援的 Windows 11 24H2 和 25H2 版本，最終可能在九月進入常規累積更新。這項工作是 Microsoft 系統性清理 Windows 11 遺留 UI 的一環，顯示公司正持續更新如 File Explorer Properties 和 Run dialog 等次要但重要的系統元件。",
    tags: ["Windows 11", "WinUI 3", "Print Management", "KB5120998", "Microsoft", "Windows 24H2", "Windows 25H2"],
    title_en: "Microsoft Rebuilds Windows 11's Legacy Print Management Tool Using WinUI 3 to Enhance System Modernization",
    summary_en: "Microsoft is systematically modernizing and refactoring traditional components within the Windows 11 operating system. Notably, the Print Management tool, which has long been presented via the MMC interface, has appeared in the Release Preview channel, indicating its upcoming large-scale release. The new Print Management adopts the WinUI 3 architecture, featuring a design more aligned with modern Windows 11 aesthetics, replacing the interface that previously appeared derived from older versions of Windows. Despite the visual changes, the new tool retains all core management functionalities, including managing printers, print queues, drivers, printer ports, and shared printers. This update is expected to arrive via cumulative update KB5120998, moving from the Release Preview into supported Windows 11 24H2 and 25H2 versions, potentially reaching general cumulative updates in September. This effort is part of Microsoft's systemic cleanup of legacy Windows 11 UIs, demonstrating the company's continuous update of minor but critical system components such as File Explorer Properties and the Run dialog.",
    tags_en: ["Windows 11", "WinUI 3", "Print Management", "KB5120998", "Microsoft", "Windows 24H2", "Windows 25H2"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Windows Latest", url: "https://windowslatest.com/2026/08/17/microsoft-just-rebuilt-one-of-windows-11s-oldest-tools-in-modern-ui-rollout-starts-in-the-next-few-days", lang: "EN" }
    ]
