    title: "Fortinet發布軟體更新修補FortiWeb與FortiManager等產品共5項漏洞",
    summary: "Fortinet近期發布軟體更新，修補包含FortiWeb、FortiManager、FortiOS等產品的5項漏洞，其中包含2項高風險漏洞。最重大漏洞為CVE-2026-26035（CVSS v3評分8.8），源於FortiWeb遠端RADIUS管理員驗證機制不當，允許攻擊者以隨機帳密登入；另一項高風險漏洞為CVE-2026-70468（CVSS v3評分7.3），影響FortiManager與FortiManager Cloud，可讓攻擊者繞過驗證並冒充受管理的FortiGate設備。其餘則包含CVE-2026-49975、CVE-2026-71407與CVE-2026-71408等中度風險漏洞，涉及阻斷服務與緩衝區溢位等問題。建議受影響組織儘速套用官方發布的軟體更新以降低安全風險。",
    tags: ["Fortinet", "FortiWeb", "FortiManager", "CVE-2026-26035", "CVE-2026-70468", "漏洞修補"],
    title_en: "Fortinet Releases Software Update Patching Five Vulnerabilities in Products Including FortiWeb and FortiManager",
    summary_en: "Fortinet recently released a software update to patch five vulnerabilities across products including FortiWeb, FortiManager, and FortiOS, two of which are high-risk. The most critical vulnerability is CVE-2026-26035 (CVSS v3 score 8.8), which stems from improper remote RADIUS administrator authentication in FortiWeb, allowing attackers to log in with random credentials; another high-risk vulnerability is CVE-2026-70468 (CVSS v3 score 7.3), affecting FortiManager and FortiManager Cloud, which could allow attackers to bypass authentication and impersonate managed FortiGate devices. The remaining vulnerabilities include medium-risk issues CVE-2026-49975, CVE-2026-71407, and CVE-2026-71408, involving denial-of-service and buffer overflow issues. Affected organizations are advised to promptly apply the official software update to mitigate security risks.",
