    title: "蘋果向 110 個國家特定使用者發出傭兵間諜軟體威脅通知",
    summary: "蘋果於 8 月 13 日向 110 個國家的特定使用者發送新一波威脅通知，警告其可能遭到傭兵間諜軟體個別鎖定。這類警示基於蘋果內部威脅情報與調查，由於需防止攻擊者調整手法，官方未公開受影響人數、國家名單及攻擊者身分等細節。針對收到通知的使用者，官方建議啟用封閉模式、尋求專業資安協助，並呼籲大眾更新軟體、啟用雙因素驗證及防範陌生連結。",
    tags: ["Apple", "傭兵間諜軟體", "威脅通知", "資安警示", "封閉模式"],
    title_en: "Apple Issues Threat Advisory Regarding Mercenary Spyware to Users in 110 Countries",
    summary_en: "On August 13, Apple issued a new wave of threat notifications to specific users in 110 countries, warning them that they might be individually targeted by mercenary spyware. These alerts are based on Apple's internal threat intelligence and investigations. Due to the need to prevent attackers from adjusting their methods, the company has not disclosed details such as the number of affected individuals, the list of countries, or the identity of the attackers. For users who received the notification, Apple recommends enabling Lockdown Mode, seeking professional cybersecurity assistance, and urging the public to update their software, enable two-factor authentication, and guard against unknown links.",
    tags_en: ["Apple", "Mercenary Spyware", "Threat Advisory", "Cybersecurity Alert", "Lockdown Mode"],
