    summary: "Apple 已發布 iOS 27 beta 6，為開發者測試版用戶提供了最新的預覽更新。iOS 27 本身是一次重大更新，核心功能圍繞著 Siri AI、Apple Intelligence 系統，以及 Liquid Glass 等介面優化。在 beta 6 版本中，開發者發現了多項介面修復與更新，例如已修復了 beta 5 版本中關於「釘選訊息」（Pinned Messages）的用戶介面錯誤，並更新了 iOS 通知動畫。此外，macOS 27 Golden Gate 也進行了介面重設計，包括「紅綠燈視窗控制」的更新，以及新增了「Golden Gate Day」和「Golden Gate Evening」動態桌布。雖然本次更新的變化主要集中在底層優化，而非視覺大改，但開發者應注意，Siri AI 和其他 Apple Intelligence 功能仍需要較新的硬體支援。本次 beta 測試將持續至八月，官方版本預計於九月與新款 iPhone 系列一同發布。",
    tags: ["iOS 27", "Apple Intelligence", "Siri AI", "macOS 27", "Apple", "beta 測試"],
    title_en: "Apple Releases iOS 27 beta 6: Developers Preview Siri AI, Apple Intelligence, and Interface Optimizations",
    summary_en: "Apple has released iOS 27 beta 6, providing the latest preview update for developer testing users. iOS 27 itself is a major update, with core features centered around Siri AI, the Apple Intelligence system, and interface optimizations like Liquid Glass. In the beta 6 version, developers have found multiple interface fixes and updates, such as the correction of a user interface bug regarding 'Pinned Messages' that was present in beta 5, and updates to the iOS notification animations. Furthermore, macOS 27 Golden Gate has undergone interface redesigns, including updates to 'Traffic Light Window Controls,' and the addition of dynamic wallpapers for 'Golden Gate Day' and 'Golden Gate Evening.' Although the changes in this update are mainly focused on underlying optimizations rather than major visual overhauls, developers should note that Siri AI and other Apple Intelligence features still require newer hardware support. This beta testing will continue until August, with the official version expected to be released in September alongside the new iPhone series.",
