    trackers: ["os", "security"],
    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "研究揭露 Defender 零日漏洞 ShieldBreak：PoC 可在全修補 Windows 10/11/Server 系統取得 SYSTEM 權限",
    summary: "資安研究人員 Nightmare Eclipse 公布了一個名為 ShieldBreak 的 Defender 零日漏洞，該漏洞被追蹤為 CVE-2026-69414。該漏洞允許本地權限受限的攻擊者，在已修補的 Windows 10、Windows 11 和 Windows Server 系統上，透過提升權限（Elevation of Privilege）的方式，取得 SYSTEM 權限。該 PoC 攻擊程式碼在最新的 Windows 11 25h2 (+Canary channel) 和 Windows Server 2025 上測試成功率達 100%。該漏洞被描述為繞過先前已披露的 RoguePlanet 漏洞（CVE-2026-50656）的機制。雖然 Microsoft 已確認知悉此「提升權限」的漏洞，並正在積極開發安全修補程式，但該漏洞的披露過程涉及研究人員與 Microsoft 之間的爭議。目前，該漏洞仍處於零日狀態，用戶需密切關注 Microsoft 官方修補公告。",
    tags: ["Microsoft Defender", "ShieldBreak", "CVE-2026-69414", "零日漏洞", "提升權限", "Windows 10", "Windows 11"],
    title_en: "Research Uncovers Defender Zero-Day Vulnerability ShieldBreak: PoC Achieves SYSTEM Privileges on Fully Patched Windows 10/11/Server Systems",
    summary_en: "Cybersecurity researcher Nightmare Eclipse has disclosed a Defender zero-day vulnerability named ShieldBreak, tracked as CVE-2026-69414. This vulnerability allows a locally restricted attacker to achieve SYSTEM privileges via Elevation of Privilege on patched Windows 10, Windows 11, and Windows Server systems. The PoC exploit code achieved a 100% success rate when tested on the latest Windows 11 25h2 (+Canary channel) and Windows Server 2025. The vulnerability is described as a mechanism that bypasses a previously disclosed RoguePlanet vulnerability (CVE-2026-50656). Although Microsoft has acknowledged this 'Elevation of Privilege' vulnerability and is actively developing a security patch, the disclosure process involves controversy between the researcher and Microsoft. Currently, the vulnerability remains a zero-day, and users must closely monitor official Microsoft patch announcements.",
    tags_en: ["Microsoft Defender", "ShieldBreak", "CVE-2026-69414", "Zero-Day Vulnerability", "Elevation of Privilege", "Windows 10", "Windows 11"],
    sources: [
      { name: "BleepingComputer", url: "https://bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/microsoft-working-on-defender-patch-for-shieldbreak-zero-day", lang: "EN" }
    ]
