    summary: "YouTube 宣布將全面更新其影片觀看次數的計算標準。自 2026 年 8 月 24 日起，所有格式的影片觀看次數將從影片開始播放的第一個畫面即時計數。此變動旨在統一平台內所有內容的觀看計數方式，以消除創作者對於觀看數據的混淆，讓創作者能更準確地掌握其真實的曝光規模和價值。雖然此更新預計會讓觀看次數的顯示速度加快，但 YouTube 強調，此變動不會影響創作者的營利模式或 YouTube 合作夥伴計畫的資格。此舉的目的是為創作者提供一個更「清晰的畫面」，以便他們能更自信地向品牌合作夥伴和贊助商展示其頻道整體規模和價值。",
    tags: ["YouTube", "觀看次數計算", "內容平台", "數據標準化", "創作者經濟"],
    title_en: "YouTube to Change Video View Count Calculation Standard, Views Will Be Counted from the Moment of Playback",
    summary_en: "YouTube has announced a comprehensive update to its video view count calculation standards. Starting August 24, 2026, view counts for all formats of videos will be counted from the very first frame of playback. This change aims to unify the view counting method across all content on the platform, eliminating confusion for creators regarding view data, allowing them to grasp their true exposure scale and value more accurately. Although this update is expected to accelerate the display speed of view counts, YouTube emphasizes that this change will not affect creators' monetization models or eligibility for the YouTube Partner Program. The goal is to provide creators with a clearer picture, enabling them to showcase their channel's overall scale and value with greater confidence to brand partners and sponsors.",
